<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>CZECH REPUBLIC GOVERNMENT LIST (970529)</p>
<p> President........................................Vaclav HAVEL</p>
<p>(Inaugurated 2 Feb 93 for a five-year term)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>COALITION GOVERNMENT (Sworn in 4 July 96)</p>
<p> Prime Minister.............................Vaclav KLAUS (ODS)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister.....................Josef LUX (KDU-CSL)</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Agriculture)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister...................Josef ZIELENIEC (ODS)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture.....................................See Deputy PM</p>
<p> Culture...............................Jaromir TALIR (KDU-CSL)</p>
<p> Defence............................Miloslav VYBORNY (KDU-CSL)</p>
<p> Development of Regions, Towns..........Tomas KVAPIL (KDU-CSL)</p>
<p> Education....................................Jiri GRUSA (ODS)</p>
<p> Environment...............................Jiri SKALICKY (ODA)</p>
<p> Finance......................................Ivan PILIP (ODS)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.........................Josef ZIELENIEC (ODS)</p>
<p> Health......................................Jan STRASKY (ODS)</p>
<p> Industry &amp; Trade............................Karel KUHNL (ODA)</p>
<p> Interior.....................................Petr NECAS (ODS)</p>
<p> Justice................................Vlasta PARKANOVA (ODA)</p>
<p> Labour &amp; Social Affairs................Jindrich VODICKA (ODS)</p>
<p> Transport..................................Martin RIMAN (ODS)</p>
<p> Without portfolio........................Pavel BRATINKA (ODA)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Parliament Chairman........................Milos ZEMAN (CSSD)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p> National Bank Governor.........................Josef TOSOVSKY</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>ODS -- Civic Democratic Party</p>
<p>KDU-CSL -- Christian Democratic Party-Czechoslovak</p>
<p>	     People's Party</p>
<p>ODA -- Civic Democratic Alliance</p>
<p>CSSD -- Social Democratic Party</p>
